      "q": "1. At last a sympathetic audience.\u201d\ni. Who says this?",
      "a": "Gerrard has said this.\nii. Why does he say it?\nAns:\nAn intruder asked him to speak about himself. That's why he said so.\niii. Is he sarcastic or serious?\nAns:\nHe said this in a sarcastic tone."
